     ("How hackers and cybercriminals attack: the 10 stages", "Comment les pirates et cybercriminels attaquent : les 10 étapes", "Uko abahackers n'abagizi ba nabi bo kuri murandasi batera: intambwe 10", "Jinsi wadukuzi na wahalifu wa mtandaoni wanavyoshambulia: hatua 10"),
