_add("cyb_careers",
     "cybersecurity jobs|cyber security jobs|cybersecurity careers|cyber security careers|cybersecurity roles|cyber security roles|cybersecurity job roles|types of cybersecurity jobs|jobs in cybersecurity|careers in cybersecurity|"
     "what does a soc analyst do|what is a soc analyst|what does a penetration tester do|what is a penetration tester|what does a security engineer do|what is a security engineer|what does a security analyst do|what is a security analyst|"
     "what does a ciso do|what is a ciso|what does a malware analyst do|what does a forensic analyst do|what does a threat hunter do|how to become a cybersecurity engineer|how to start a career in cybersecurity|how to become an ethical hacker|how do i become a cybersecurity expert|"
     "metiers de la cybersecurite|carrieres en cybersecurite|emplois en cybersecurite|que fait un analyste soc|qu'est-ce qu'un analyste soc|que fait un testeur d'intrusion|que fait un ingenieur en cybersecurite|comment devenir ingenieur en cybersecurite|comment devenir hacker ethique|comment commencer une carriere en cybersecurite|"
     "imirimo y'umutekano wa cyber|akazi mu mutekano wa cyber|inshingano mu mutekano wa cyber|umusesenguzi wa soc akora iki|soc analyst akora iki|ukora penetration test akora iki|injeniyeri w'umutekano akora iki|uko waba injeniyeri w'umutekano wa cyber|uko wahinduka ethical hacker|uko watangira umwuga w'umutekano wa cyber|"
     "kazi za usalama wa mtandao|kazi katika usalama wa mtandao|taaluma za usalama wa mtandao|majukumu ya usalama wa mtandao|soc analyst anafanya nini|mjaribu wa uvamizi anafanya nini|mhandisi wa usalama anafanya nini|jinsi ya kuwa mhandisi wa usalama wa mtandao|jinsi ya kuwa mdukuzi mwenye maadili|jinsi ya kuanza kazi ya usalama wa mtandao",
     ("Cybersecurity careers: the main roles and what they do", "Carrières en cybersécurité : les principaux rôles et leurs missions", "Imirimo mu mutekano wa cyber: inshingano z'ingenzi n'ibyo bakora", "Taaluma za usalama wa mtandao: majukumu makuu na kazi zao"),
     ("Cybersecurity is a large field with technical and non-technical paths. Here are the main roles. Ask “cybersecurity certifications” to see recognised qualifications, and “how do cybersecurity engineers protect systems” for the work itself.",
      "La cybersécurité est un grand domaine avec des voies techniques et non techniques. Voici les principaux rôles. Demandez « certifications en cybersécurité » pour les qualifications reconnues, et « comment les ingénieurs protègent les systèmes » pour le travail lui-même.",
      "Umutekano wa cyber ni urwego runini rufite inzira za tekiniki n'izitari iza tekiniki. Dore inshingano z'ingenzi. Baza «impamyabumenyi z'umutekano wa cyber» urebe impamyabushobozi zemewe, na «abashinzwe umutekano barinda bate sisitemu» urebe akazi ubwako.",
      "Usalama wa mtandao ni uwanja mkubwa wenye njia za kiufundi na zisizo za kiufundi. Haya ni majukumu makuu. Uliza «vyeti vya usalama wa mtandao» uone sifa zinazotambulika, na «wahandisi wa usalama hulindaje mifumo» uone kazi yenyewe."),
     (["**SOC analyst:** watches alerts and logs (SIEM/EDR) around the clock, decides what is real, and starts the response.",
       "**Security engineer / architect:** designs and builds the defences (network, cloud, identity, encryption) and chooses controls.",
       "**Penetration tester / ethical hacker:** with written permission, tries to break in to find weaknesses before criminals do, and reports how to fix them.",
       "**Red team / blue team / purple team:** attackers-for-hire who test the whole organisation / the defenders who detect and respond / both working together.",
       "**Incident responder:** takes charge during an attack: contain, remove the attacker, recover, and learn.",
       "**Digital forensics analyst:** recovers and preserves evidence from devices and logs, with chain of custody, for investigations and courts.",
       "**Malware analyst / reverse engineer:** studies malicious software to understand what it does and how to detect it.",
       "**Threat intelligence analyst / threat hunter:** tracks attacker groups and techniques and searches for hidden intruders.",
       "**Application security / DevSecOps engineer:** helps developers write safe code, tests apps (OWASP Top 10) and automates security in the build pipeline.",
       "**Cloud security engineer:** secures cloud accounts, storage, containers and identities under the shared-responsibility model.",
       "**GRC (governance, risk, compliance) and auditor:** policies, risk assessments, standards (ISO/IEC 27001), audits and legal duties.",
       "**CISO, DPO and privacy officer:** the CISO leads the security programme; the data-protection officer makes sure personal data is handled lawfully.",
       "**Security awareness trainer and fraud analyst:** teach people to resist scams; spot fraud in banking and mobile-money transactions.",
       "**How to start:** learn networking, Linux and Windows basics, a scripting language (Python), web basics; practise legally on labs and capture-the-flag (CTF) platforms; build a portfolio; get an entry certification; join local communities. Always test only systems you own or have written permission to test."],
      ["**Analyste SOC :** surveille alertes et journaux (SIEM/EDR) en continu, décide ce qui est réel et lance la réponse.",
       "**Ingénieur / architecte sécurité :** conçoit et construit les défenses (réseau, cloud, identité, chiffrement) et choisit les contrôles.",
       "**Testeur d'intrusion / hacker éthique :** avec autorisation écrite, tente de s'introduire pour trouver les faiblesses avant les criminels, et indique comment corriger.",
       "**Red team / blue team / purple team :** attaquants mandatés qui testent toute l'organisation / défenseurs qui détectent et répondent / les deux ensemble.",
       "**Intervenant en incident :** prend la main pendant une attaque : contenir, expulser l'attaquant, rétablir, apprendre.",
       "**Analyste en forensique numérique :** récupère et préserve les preuves des appareils et journaux, avec chaîne de traçabilité, pour enquêtes et tribunaux.",
       "**Analyste de malwares / rétro-ingénieur :** étudie les logiciels malveillants pour comprendre leur action et les détecter.",
       "**Analyste en renseignement sur les menaces / chasseur de menaces :** suit groupes et techniques d'attaque et cherche les intrus cachés.",
       "**Ingénieur sécurité applicative / DevSecOps :** aide les développeurs à coder sûr, teste les applications (OWASP Top 10) et automatise la sécurité dans la chaîne de build.",
       "**Ingénieur sécurité cloud :** sécurise comptes cloud, stockage, conteneurs et identités selon le modèle de responsabilité partagée.",
       "**GRC (gouvernance, risques, conformité) et auditeur :** politiques, évaluations de risques, normes (ISO/IEC 27001), audits et obligations légales.",
       "**RSSI, DPO et responsable vie privée :** le RSSI dirige le programme de sécurité ; le délégué à la protection des données veille au traitement légal des données personnelles.",
       "**Formateur en sensibilisation et analyste fraude :** apprennent aux gens à résister aux arnaques ; repèrent la fraude dans les opérations bancaires et d'argent mobile.",
       "**Pour commencer :** apprendre réseaux, bases de Linux et Windows, un langage de script (Python), bases du web ; s'entraîner légalement sur des labos et plateformes de capture-the-flag (CTF) ; constituer un portfolio ; passer une certification d'entrée ; rejoindre des communautés locales. Ne testez que des systèmes qui vous appartiennent ou avec autorisation écrite."],
      ["**SOC analyst:** akurikirana ubutumwa bwo kuburira na logs (SIEM/EDR) amasaha yose, agahitamo ibyo ari ukuri, agatangiza igisubizo.",
       "**Security engineer / architect:** ategura akanubaka uburyo bwo kwirinda (umuyoboro, cloud, umwirondoro, encryption) akanahitamo controls.",
       "**Penetration tester / ethical hacker:** afite uruhushya rwanditse, agerageza kwinjira kugira ngo ashake intege nke mbere y'abagizi ba nabi, agatanga raporo y'uko zikosorwa.",
       "**Red team / blue team / purple team:** abatera bahawe akazi bagerageza ikigo cyose / abarinzi batahura bagasubiza / bombi bakorana.",
       "**Incident responder:** afata ubuyobozi mu gihe cy'igitero: kugabanya, gukuraho umushimusi, kugarura, kwigira.",
       "**Digital forensics analyst:** agarura akabika ibimenyetso biva mu bikoresho no muri logs, afite chain of custody, mu iperereza no mu nkiko.",
       "**Malware analyst / reverse engineer:** yiga porogaramu mbi kugira ngo amenye icyo zikora n'uko zitahurwa.",
       "**Threat intelligence analyst / threat hunter:** akurikirana amatsinda y'abashimusi n'uburyo bakoresha, agashaka abinjiye bihishe.",
       "**Application security / DevSecOps engineer:** afasha abategura porogaramu kwandika code itekanye, apima porogaramu (OWASP Top 10) agashyira umutekano muri automation.",
       "**Cloud security engineer:** arinda konti za cloud, ububiko, containers n'imyirondoro hakurikijwe shared-responsibility model.",
       "**GRC (imiyoborere, ibyago, kubahiriza) n'umugenzuzi:** politiki, isuzuma ry'ibyago, ibipimo (ISO/IEC 27001), ubugenzuzi n'inshingano z'amategeko.",
       "**CISO, DPO n'ushinzwe ibanga ry'abantu:** CISO ayobora gahunda y'umutekano; DPO yita ku gukoresha amakuru bwite mu buryo bwemewe.",
       "**Umwigisha wo gukangurira n'umusesenguzi w'uburiganya:** bigisha abantu kwirinda uburiganya; batahura uburiganya mu bikorwa bya banki na mobile money.",
       "**Uko watangira:** wige network, shingiro rya Linux na Windows, ururimi rwa scripting (Python), shingiro rya web; witoze mu buryo bwemewe mu bigo by'imyitozo na CTF; ubaka portfolio; ufate impamyabushobozi y'ibanze; winjire mu bimina by'ahantu. Gerageza gusa sisitemu zawe cyangwa ufite uruhushya rwanditse."],
      ["**SOC analyst:** hufuatilia tahadhari na logs (SIEM/EDR) saa zote, huamua kipi ni halisi, na kuanzisha mwitikio.",
       "**Security engineer / architect:** hubuni na kujenga ulinzi (mtandao, cloud, utambulisho, usimbaji) na kuchagua udhibiti.",
       "**Penetration tester / ethical hacker:** kwa idhini ya maandishi, hujaribu kuingia kutafuta udhaifu kabla ya wahalifu, na kuripoti jinsi ya kurekebisha.",
       "**Red team / blue team / purple team:** washambulizi walioajiriwa kujaribu shirika zima / watetezi wanaogundua na kukabiliana / wote wakifanya kazi pamoja.",
       "**Incident responder:** huchukua uongozi wakati wa shambulio: kuzuia, kuondoa mshambulizi, kurejesha, kujifunza.",
       "**Digital forensics analyst:** hurejesha na kuhifadhi ushahidi kutoka vifaa na logs, kwa chain of custody, kwa uchunguzi na mahakama.",
       "**Malware analyst / reverse engineer:** huchunguza programu hasidi kuelewa kinachofanya na jinsi ya kuigundua.",
       "**Threat intelligence analyst / threat hunter:** hufuatilia makundi ya washambulizi na mbinu zao na kutafuta wavamizi waliojificha.",
       "**Application security / DevSecOps engineer:** huwasaidia wasanidi kuandika msimbo salama, hujaribu programu (OWASP Top 10) na kuendesha usalama kiotomatiki kwenye ujenzi.",
       "**Cloud security engineer:** hulinda akaunti za cloud, hifadhi, containers na utambulisho chini ya shared-responsibility model.",
       "**GRC (utawala, hatari, uzingatiaji) na mkaguzi:** sera, tathmini za hatari, viwango (ISO/IEC 27001), ukaguzi na wajibu wa kisheria.",
       "**CISO, DPO na afisa faragha:** CISO huongoza programu ya usalama; afisa wa ulinzi wa data huhakikisha data binafsi inashughulikiwa kisheria.",
       "**Mkufunzi wa uhamasishaji na mchambuzi wa ulaghai:** hufundisha watu kupinga utapeli; hugundua ulaghai kwenye miamala ya benki na pesa za simu.",
       "**Jinsi ya kuanza:** jifunze mitandao, misingi ya Linux na Windows, lugha ya scripting (Python), misingi ya wavuti; fanya mazoezi kihalali kwenye maabara na majukwaa ya capture-the-flag (CTF); jenga portfolio; pata cheti cha kuanzia; jiunge na jumuiya za hapa. Jaribu mifumo yako tu au ukiwa na idhini ya maandishi."]),
     ("Roles in cybersecurity (14)", "Rôles en cybersécurité (14)", "Inshingano mu mutekano wa cyber (14)", "Majukumu ya usalama wa mtandao (14)"),
     ["cyb_certifications", "cyb_defender_methods"])

_add("cyb_certifications",
     "cybersecurity certifications|cyber security certifications|security certifications|best cybersecurity certifications|top cybersecurity certifications|list of cybersecurity certifications|it security certifications|what is cissp|what is a cissp|what is ceh|what is a ceh|"
     "what is oscp|what is an oscp|what is security+|what is comptia security+|what is cism|what is cisa|what is sscp|what is ccsp|what is giac|cissp vs ceh|which cybersecurity certification should i get|which cyber certification is best for beginners|"
     "certifications en cybersecurite|certifications de securite|meilleures certifications en cybersecurite|c'est quoi cissp|qu'est-ce que cissp|c'est quoi ceh|c'est quoi oscp|c'est quoi security+|quelle certification en cybersecurite choisir|"
     "impamyabushobozi z'umutekano wa cyber|impamyabumenyi z'umutekano wa cyber|cissp ni iki|ceh ni iki|oscp ni iki|security+ ni iki|ni iyihe mpamyabushobozi y'umutekano wa cyber nahitamo|"
     "vyeti vya usalama wa mtandao|vyeti bora vya usalama wa mtandao|cissp ni nini|ceh ni nini|oscp ni nini|security+ ni nini|cheti gani cha usalama wa mtandao nichague",
     ("Recognised cybersecurity certifications and who they are for", "Certifications reconnues en cybersécurité et à qui elles s'adressent", "Impamyabushobozi zemewe mu mutekano wa cyber n'abo zigenewe", "Vyeti vinavyotambulika vya usalama wa mtandao na kwa nani"),
     ("A certificate does not replace skill, but it proves knowledge to employers. These are widely recognised ones (names belong to their organisations; check each official website for current exam content, prerequisites and fees, which change).",
      "Un certificat ne remplace pas la compétence mais prouve des connaissances aux employeurs. Voici des certifications largement reconnues (les noms appartiennent à leurs organismes ; consultez chaque site officiel pour le contenu, les prérequis et les frais actuels, qui changent).",
      "Impamyabushobozi ntisimbura ubuhanga ariko yerekana ubumenyi ku bakoresha. Izi zizwi cyane (amazina ni ay'ibigo bizitanga; reba urubuga rwemewe rwa buri imwe ku bijyanye n'ibizamini, ibisabwa n'ibiciro bigezweho, bihinduka).",
      "Cheti hakibadilishi ujuzi lakini huthibitisha maarifa kwa waajiri. Hivi vinatambulika sana (majina ni ya mashirika yake; angalia tovuti rasmi ya kila moja kwa maudhui ya mtihani, mahitaji na ada za sasa, ambazo hubadilika)."),
     (["**CompTIA Security+:** a common first, vendor-neutral certification covering core security concepts: threats, cryptography, identity, network and operations.",
       "**CompTIA CySA+ and PenTest+:** analyst-level (detection and response) and penetration-testing skills.",
       "**(ISC)² SSCP and CISSP:** SSCP for hands-on practitioners; **CISSP** (Certified Information Systems Security Professional) is a senior, broad certification across eight security domains and requires professional experience.",
       "**(ISC)² CCSP:** cloud security professional.",
       "**ISACA CISA, CISM, CRISC:** CISA for audit and control; CISM for security management; CRISC for risk and control.",
       "**EC-Council CEH:** Certified Ethical Hacker, an awareness of attack tools and techniques used legally for testing.",
       "**OffSec OSCP:** Offensive Security Certified Professional, known for a hands-on practical exam in which you must compromise lab machines under time limits.",
       "**GIAC/SANS (for example GSEC):** respected, training-linked certifications for many specialities.",
       "**Vendor certificates:** Cisco, Microsoft, AWS and Google Cloud security certificates for their platforms.",
       "**Choosing:** a beginner often starts with Security+ (or a networking certificate), then picks a path: defence/SOC (CySA+, GIAC), offensive (PenTest+, OSCP), cloud (CCSP, vendor), management/risk (CISM, CISSP, CISA). Combine with practice labs and CTFs."],
      ["**CompTIA Security+ :** première certification courante, neutre vis-à-vis des fournisseurs, couvrant les notions clés : menaces, cryptographie, identité, réseau et opérations.",
       "**CompTIA CySA+ et PenTest+ :** niveau analyste (détection et réponse) et compétences de test d'intrusion.",
       "**(ISC)² SSCP et CISSP :** SSCP pour les praticiens ; **CISSP** (Certified Information Systems Security Professional) est une certification senior, large, sur huit domaines et exige de l'expérience professionnelle.",
       "**(ISC)² CCSP :** professionnel de la sécurité du cloud.",
       "**ISACA CISA, CISM, CRISC :** CISA pour l'audit et le contrôle ; CISM pour le management de la sécurité ; CRISC pour risques et contrôles.",
       "**EC-Council CEH :** Certified Ethical Hacker, connaissance des outils et techniques d'attaque utilisés légalement pour tester.",
       "**OffSec OSCP :** Offensive Security Certified Professional, connue pour un examen pratique où il faut compromettre des machines de laboratoire dans un temps limité.",
       "**GIAC/SANS (par exemple GSEC) :** certifications respectées, liées aux formations, pour de nombreuses spécialités.",
       "**Certificats d'éditeurs :** Cisco, Microsoft, AWS et Google Cloud pour leurs plateformes.",
       "**Choisir :** un débutant commence souvent par Security+ (ou un certificat réseau) puis choisit une voie : défense/SOC (CySA+, GIAC), offensive (PenTest+, OSCP), cloud (CCSP, éditeurs), management/risque (CISM, CISSP, CISA). Associez avec labos et CTF."],
      ["**CompTIA Security+:** impamyabushobozi y'ibanze ikunze gufatwa mbere, idashingiye ku muntu runaka, isobanura ingingo z'ingenzi: ibyago, cryptography, umwirondoro, umuyoboro n'imikorere.",
       "**CompTIA CySA+ na PenTest+:** urwego rw'umusesenguzi (gutahura no gusubiza) n'ubuhanga bwa penetration testing.",
       "**(ISC)² SSCP na CISSP:** SSCP ku bakora ibikorwa; **CISSP** ni impamyabushobozi y'abakuru, yagutse mu nzego umunani z'umutekano, isaba uburambe mu kazi.",
       "**(ISC)² CCSP:** inzobere mu mutekano wa cloud.",
       "**ISACA CISA, CISM, CRISC:** CISA ku bugenzuzi; CISM ku micungire y'umutekano; CRISC ku byago.",
       "**EC-Council CEH:** Certified Ethical Hacker, ubumenyi bw'ibikoresho n'uburyo bw'ibitero bikoreshwa mu buryo bwemewe mu bipimo.",
       "**OffSec OSCP:** izwi ku kizamini gifatika aho ugomba kwinjira mu mashini z'isuzuma mu gihe gito.",
       "**GIAC/SANS (urugero GSEC):** impamyabushobozi zubahwa zijyanye n'amahugurwa ku nzego nyinshi.",
       "**Iz'ibigo:** Cisco, Microsoft, AWS na Google Cloud ku mpuzamikoro zabo.",
       "**Guhitamo:** utangiye akenshi atangirira kuri Security+ (cyangwa network), hanyuma agahitamo inzira: kwirinda/SOC (CySA+, GIAC), gutera mu buryo bwemewe (PenTest+, OSCP), cloud (CCSP), imiyoborere/ibyago (CISM, CISSP, CISA). Ongeraho imyitozo na CTF."],
      ["**CompTIA Security+:** cheti cha kwanza cha kawaida, kisichoegemea muuzaji, kinachoshughulikia dhana kuu: vitisho, kriptografia, utambulisho, mtandao na uendeshaji.",
       "**CompTIA CySA+ na PenTest+:** ngazi ya mchambuzi (kugundua na kukabiliana) na ujuzi wa kujaribu uvamizi.",
       "**(ISC)² SSCP na CISSP:** SSCP kwa watendaji; **CISSP** ni cheti cha juu, pana, kwenye nyanja nane za usalama na kinahitaji uzoefu wa kazi.",
       "**(ISC)² CCSP:** mtaalamu wa usalama wa cloud.",
       "**ISACA CISA, CISM, CRISC:** CISA kwa ukaguzi; CISM kwa usimamizi wa usalama; CRISC kwa hatari na udhibiti.",
       "**EC-Council CEH:** Certified Ethical Hacker, uelewa wa zana na mbinu za mashambulizi zinazotumika kihalali kujaribu.",
       "**OffSec OSCP:** inajulikana kwa mtihani wa vitendo ambapo unapaswa kuingia kwenye mashine za maabara ndani ya muda.",
       "**GIAC/SANS (mfano GSEC):** vyeti vinavyoheshimika vinavyohusiana na mafunzo kwa taaluma nyingi.",
       "**Vyeti vya wauzaji:** Cisco, Microsoft, AWS na Google Cloud kwa majukwaa yao.",
       "**Kuchagua:** anayeanza mara nyingi huanza na Security+ (au cheti cha mitandao), kisha huchagua njia: ulinzi/SOC (CySA+, GIAC), ushambuliaji halali (PenTest+, OSCP), cloud (CCSP), usimamizi/hatari (CISM, CISSP, CISA). Changanya na maabara na CTF."]),
     ("Certifications", "Certifications", "Impamyabushobozi", "Vyeti"),
     ["cyb_careers"])

_add("cyb_ai_cyber",
     "ai and cybersecurity|artificial intelligence and cybersecurity|ai in cybersecurity|how do hackers use ai|how do criminals use ai|how is ai used in cyber attacks|how is ai used in cybersecurity|ai powered scams|ai scams|ai powered cyber attacks|"
     "how is ai used for scams|how to spot ai scams|how to protect myself from ai scams|how to detect deepfakes|how to spot a deepfake|how to detect voice cloning|ai threats|ai security threats|how ai helps cybersecurity|how ai helps defenders|"
     "l'ia et la cybersecurite|ia et cybersecurite|comment les pirates utilisent l'ia|comment les criminels utilisent l'ia|arnaques par ia|arnaques ia|comment reperer un deepfake|comment detecter un deepfake|menaces liees a l'ia|comment l'ia aide la cybersecurite|"
     "ai n'umutekano wa cyber|uko abahackers bakoresha ai|uko abagizi ba nabi bakoresha ai|uburiganya bwa ai|uko wamenya deepfake|uko wamenya amajwi yakopwe na ai|ibyago bya ai mu mutekano|uko ai ifasha umutekano wa cyber|"
     "ai na usalama wa mtandao|jinsi wadukuzi wanavyotumia ai|jinsi wahalifu wanavyotumia ai|utapeli wa ai|jinsi ya kutambua deepfake|jinsi ya kutambua sauti iliyonakiliwa na ai|vitisho vya ai|jinsi ai inavyosaidia usalama wa mtandao",
     ("AI and cybersecurity: how criminals use it, how defenders use it, and how to stay safe", "IA et cybersécurité : usages criminels, usages défensifs et comment rester en sécurité", "AI n'umutekano wa cyber: uko abagizi ba nabi bayikoresha, uko abarinzi bayikoresha n'uko wakwirinda", "AI na usalama wa mtandao: jinsi wahalifu wanavyoitumia, watetezi wanavyoitumia na jinsi ya kuwa salama"),
     ("Artificial intelligence helps both sides. It makes scams more convincing and cheaper, and it helps defenders find attacks faster. The basic rules do not change: verify, never share codes, and do not trust media just because it looks or sounds real.",
      "L'intelligence artificielle aide les deux camps. Elle rend les arnaques plus convaincantes et moins chères, et aide les défenseurs à détecter plus vite les attaques. Les règles de base ne changent pas : vérifier, ne jamais partager de codes et ne pas croire un média parce qu'il semble ou sonne vrai.",
      "Ubwenge buhangano (AI) bufasha impande zombi. Butuma uburiganya bwemeza kurushaho kandi buhendutse, kandi bufasha abarinzi gutahura ibitero vuba. Amategeko y'ibanze ntahinduka: genzura, ntusangize kode, kandi ntukizere amashusho cyangwa amajwi kuko asa cyangwa yumvikana nk'ukuri.",
      "Akili bandia (AI) husaidia pande zote. Hufanya utapeli uonekane wa kuaminika zaidi na wa gharama ndogo, na husaidia watetezi kugundua mashambulizi haraka. Kanuni za msingi hazibadiliki: hakiki, usishiriki misimbo, na usiamini picha au sauti kwa sababu zinaonekana au zinasikika halisi."),
     (["**AI-written phishing:** perfect spelling and local language, personalised to you, at huge scale. *Tip:* do not judge by language quality; judge by the request (money, codes, urgency) and verify.",
       "**Voice cloning:** a few seconds of someone's voice can be copied: ‘your son is in trouble, send money’. *Tip:* hang up and call back on the real number; agree a family code word; be suspicious of urgency and secrecy.",
       "**Deepfake video and images:** fake faces of leaders, celebrities, ‘investment gurus’ or a relative on a video call. *Tip:* check the source, look for odd lighting, blinking, lip-sync or hands, ask the person to do something unexpected on a live call, and verify through another channel.",
       "**Fake profiles and chatbots:** AI-run romance and investment ‘friends’ that chat for weeks. *Tip:* never send money to someone you have not met; reverse-search photos; be wary of any new ‘friend’ who talks about crypto or trading.",
       "**Fake websites and ads made fast:** convincing shops and loan apps appear overnight. *Tip:* check the domain, reviews from independent sites, and payment methods.",
       "**Attacks on AI systems:** prompt injection (hidden instructions in a document or page), data poisoning, model theft and leaking data pasted into chatbots. *Tip:* do not paste secrets or personal data into AI tools; treat AI answers as drafts to verify.",
       "**Defence with AI:** spam and phishing filters, anomaly detection, SOC triage, malware classification, fraud scoring, faster log analysis. AI helps but makes mistakes (false alarms and misses), so people stay in the loop.",
       "**Good habits:** verify identity by a second channel; use passkeys/MFA (they resist phishing); keep a ‘pause and check’ rule for money and codes; label and check AI-generated content; follow your organisation's AI-use policy."],
      ["**Hameçonnage rédigé par IA :** orthographe parfaite et langue locale, personnalisé, à grande échelle. *Conseil :* ne jugez pas la qualité de la langue ; jugez la demande (argent, codes, urgence) et vérifiez.",
       "**Clonage de voix :** quelques secondes de voix suffisent à la copier : « ton fils est en difficulté, envoie de l'argent ». *Conseil :* raccrochez et rappelez le vrai numéro ; convenez d'un mot de code familial ; méfiez-vous de l'urgence et du secret.",
       "**Vidéos et images deepfake :** faux visages de dirigeants, célébrités, « gourous de l'investissement » ou proche en visio. *Conseil :* vérifiez la source, repérez lumière, clignements, synchro labiale ou mains étranges, demandez un geste inattendu en direct et vérifiez par un autre canal.",
       "**Faux profils et chatbots :** « amis » amoureux ou d'investissement pilotés par IA qui discutent des semaines. *Conseil :* n'envoyez jamais d'argent à quelqu'un non rencontré ; recherchez les photos ; méfiez-vous d'un nouvel « ami » qui parle de crypto ou de trading.",
       "**Faux sites et publicités créés vite :** boutiques et applis de prêt convaincantes apparaissent en une nuit. *Conseil :* vérifiez le domaine, des avis sur des sites indépendants et les moyens de paiement.",
       "**Attaques sur les systèmes d'IA :** injection de prompt (instructions cachées dans un document ou une page), empoisonnement de données, vol de modèle, fuite de données collées dans des chatbots. *Conseil :* ne collez ni secrets ni données personnelles dans les outils d'IA ; traitez les réponses comme des brouillons à vérifier.",
       "**Défense avec l'IA :** filtres anti-spam et hameçonnage, détection d'anomalies, tri SOC, classification de malwares, score de fraude, analyse de journaux plus rapide. L'IA aide mais se trompe (fausses alertes et oublis) : l'humain reste dans la boucle.",
       "**Bonnes habitudes :** vérifier l'identité par un second canal ; passkeys/MFA (résistants à l'hameçonnage) ; règle « pause et vérification » pour argent et codes ; étiqueter et vérifier les contenus générés par IA ; suivre la politique d'usage de l'IA de votre organisation."],
      ["**Phishing yanditswe na AI:** imyandikire itunganye n'ururimi rwo mu gihugu, ihuje nawe, ku rugero runini. *Inama:* ntukemeze ubwiza bw'ururimi; reba icyo basaba (amafaranga, kode, kwihutisha) ugenzure.",
       "**Voice cloning:** amasegonda make y'ijwi ry'umuntu arahagije kuyakoporora: «umuhungu wawe ari mu kaga, ohereza amafaranga». *Inama:* hagarika uhamagare nimero nyayo; mwumvikane ku jambo ry'ibanga mu muryango; witondere kwihutisha n'ibanga.",
       "**Amashusho ya deepfake:** isura z'ibinyoma z'abayobozi, ibyamamare, «abatoza b'ishoramari» cyangwa umuvandimwe kuri video call. *Inama:* genzura inkomoko, reba urumuri, guhumbya, imiterere y'iminwa cyangwa ibiganza bidasanzwe, saba umuntu gukora igikorwa gitunguranye kuri video, kandi ugenzure unyuze ku yindi nzira.",
       "**Konti z'ibinyoma na chatbots:** «inshuti» z'urukundo cyangwa z'ishoramari zicungwa na AI ziganira ibyumweru. *Inama:* ntuzohereze amafaranga ku wo utahuye; shakisha amafoto; ugire amakenga ku «nshuti nshya» ivuga crypto cyangwa trading.",
       "**Imbuga n'amatangazo by'ibinyoma bikorwa vuba:** amaduka na porogaramu z'inguzanyo zisa n'izukuri zigaragara mu ijoro rimwe. *Inama:* genzura domain, ibitekerezo ku mbuga zigenga n'uburyo bwo kwishyura.",
       "**Ibitero kuri sisitemu za AI:** prompt injection (amabwiriza ahishe mu nyandiko cyangwa urupapuro), data poisoning, kwiba model no kumena amakuru yashyizwe muri chatbots. *Inama:* ntushyire amabanga cyangwa amakuru bwite mu bikoresho bya AI; fata ibisubizo bya AI nk'ibigerageza ugomba kugenzura.",
       "**Kwirinda dukoresheje AI:** ibishungura spam na phishing, gutahura ibidasanzwe, gutondeka muri SOC, gutondeka malware, ibipimo by'uburiganya, gusesengura logs vuba. AI irafasha ariko irakosa (impuruza z'ibinyoma no kwibagirwa), bityo abantu bakomeza kuba muri gahunda.",
       "**Imigirire myiza:** genzura umwirondoro unyuze ku yindi nzira; koresha passkeys/MFA (birwanya phishing); itegeko «hagarara ugenzure» ku mafaranga na kode; shyiraho ikimenyetso ugenzure ibikozwe na AI; ukurikize politiki y'ikigo ku ikoreshwa rya AI."],
      ["**Phishing iliyoandikwa na AI:** tahajia kamilifu na lugha ya hapa, iliyobinafsishwa, kwa kiwango kikubwa. *Kidokezo:* usihukumu kwa ubora wa lugha; hukumu kwa ombi (pesa, misimbo, haraka) na uhakiki.",
       "**Kunakili sauti:** sekunde chache za sauti zinatosha kuinakili: «mwanao yuko matatani, tuma pesa». *Kidokezo:* kata simu na upige namba halisi; kubaliana neno la siri la familia; shuku haraka na siri.",
       "**Video na picha za deepfake:** nyuso bandia za viongozi, watu mashuhuri, «magwiji wa uwekezaji» au ndugu kwenye simu ya video. *Kidokezo:* kagua chanzo, angalia mwanga, kupepesa, ulandanifu wa midomo au mikono isiyo ya kawaida, mwombe afanye kitu kisichotarajiwa moja kwa moja, na uhakiki kupitia njia nyingine.",
       "**Wasifu bandia na chatbots:** «marafiki» wa mapenzi au uwekezaji wanaoendeshwa na AI wanaozungumza kwa wiki. *Kidokezo:* usitume pesa kwa usiyekutana naye; tafuta picha; kuwa makini na «rafiki mpya» anayezungumzia crypto au trading.",
       "**Tovuti na matangazo bandia yanayotengenezwa haraka:** maduka na programu za mikopo zinazoaminika huonekana usiku mmoja. *Kidokezo:* kagua domain, maoni kwenye tovuti huru na njia za malipo.",
       "**Mashambulizi dhidi ya mifumo ya AI:** prompt injection (maagizo yaliyofichwa kwenye hati au ukurasa), data poisoning, wizi wa modeli na kuvuja kwa data iliyobandikwa kwenye chatbots. *Kidokezo:* usibandike siri au data binafsi kwenye zana za AI; chukulia majibu ya AI kama rasimu za kuhakiki.",
       "**Ulinzi kwa AI:** vichujio vya spam na phishing, kugundua yasiyo ya kawaida, uchambuzi wa awali wa SOC, kuainisha malware, alama za ulaghai, uchambuzi wa logs wa haraka. AI husaidia lakini hukosea (tahadhari za uongo na kukosa), hivyo binadamu hubaki kwenye mchakato.",
       "**Tabia nzuri:** thibitisha utambulisho kwa njia ya pili; tumia passkeys/MFA (hupinga phishing); kanuni ya «simama na ukague» kwa pesa na misimbo; weka alama na hakiki maudhui ya AI; fuata sera ya matumizi ya AI ya shirika lako."]),
     ("AI threats and defences", "Menaces et défenses liées à l'IA", "Ibyago n'uburyo bwo kwirinda bya AI", "Vitisho na kinga za AI"),
     ["cyb_scam_prevention", "cyb_personal_protection"])


def find(question, lang="en"):
    """The playbook guide for a big overview question (hacker methods, attack families, how engineers protect systems, MITRE tactics, how accounts get hacked,
    how to avoid scams, what to do after a scam, personal and business protection, careers, certifications, AI and cybersecurity), else None."""
    q = fold(question)
    if not q or len(q) > 170:
        return None
    best, best_len = None, 0
    for e, kws in _RAW:
        for kw in kws:
            if len(kw) > best_len and has_phrase(q, [kw]):
                best, best_len = e, len(kw)
    if best is None:   # natural paraphrases ("how can I avoid falling for scams", "I was scammed, what now")
        try:
            from cyber_intent import find_id
            want = find_id(question)
            for e, _kws in _RAW:
                if e["id"] == want:
                    return e
        except Exception:
            pass
    return best


